# Production build configuration (read by `vite build` / `npm run deploy`).
#
# ALL API calls go to the backend Worker origin. The frontend `trading`
# Cloudflare Worker is static-only (no API handler), so the SPA is built with
# an absolute API base: every request from src/api/client.ts resolves to
#   https://web-back.blackb0ss1.workers.dev/api/*
#
# The backend must answer CORS preflights (server.mjs does: OPTIONS -> 200
# with Access-Control-Allow-Origin/Methods/Headers).
VITE_API_URL=https://web-back.blackb0ss1.workers.dev
